
### 1. Create order with Pokemon card
GET http://localhost:8080/add-to-order?product=Pokemon%20card
Accept: application/json

> {%
    const body = typeof response.body === "string"
        ? JSON.parse(response.body)
        : response.body;
    client.global.set("orderId", body.id);
%}

### 2. Add Pokemon board
GET http://localhost:8080/add-to-order?orderId={{orderId}}&product=Pokemon%20board
Accept: application/json


### 3. Process order
GET http://localhost:8080/confirm-order?orderId={{orderId}}
Accept: application/json